# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day25

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| emerge | 나타나다, 부상하다 | A new theory emerged from the research. |
| generate | 생성하다 | Solar panels generate electricity. |
| distribute | 분배하다, 배포하다 | The resources were distributed equally. |

---

## Synonyms

### emerge
→ appear / arise

### generate
→ produce / create

### distribute
→ spread / allocate

---

## Useful Collocations

emerge as a leader
→ 지도자로 부상하다

generate energy
→ 에너지를 생산하다

distribute resources
→ 자원을 분배하다

